---
layout: base.njk
title: Vital Sparks
---
<h1>Vital Sparks</h1>
<p>Essays about the poetry, history, and people behind the songs in <em>The Sacred Harp</em>.</p>
<p><a href="https://vitalsparks.beehiiv.com/">Subscribe to the newsletter on Beehiiv</a></p>
{%- set currentVolume = "" %}
{%- for essay in collections.essays %}
{%- if essay.data.volume != currentVolume %}
{%- if currentVolume != "" %}</ul>{% endif %}
{%- set currentVolume = essay.data.volume %}
<h2>Volume {{ currentVolume }}</h2>
<ul class="essays">
{%- endif %}
  <li><span class="sub">Issue {{ essay.data.issue }}</span> &middot; <a href="{{ essay.url | url }}">{{ essay.data.title }}</a>
  {%- if essay.data.subtitle %}<br><span class="sub">{{ essay.data.subtitle }}</span>{% endif %}</li>
{%- endfor %}
</ul>
